uously during hospital stay (expected average of hospital stay: 4 weeks) and at follow-up two weeks after discharge"}]},"eligibilityModule":{"eligibilityCriteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Age 65+ years old\n* Inpatients treated at one of the geriatric psychiatry study sites.\n* Signed consent form ( Patient and/or legally authorized custodian)\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients that are incapable to give their informed consent and are not under legally authorized custodianship.\n* Parallel participation in another clinical trial.","healthyVolunteers":false,"sex":"ALL","minimumAge":"65 Years","stdAges":["OLDER_ADULT"]},"contactsLocationsModule":{"locations":[{"facility":"Bezirkskrankenhaus Augsburg","city":"Augsburg","country":"Germany","geoPoint":{"lat":48.37154,"lon":10.89851}},{"facility":"Krankenhaus Hedwigshöhe","city":"Berlin","country":"Germany","geoPoint":{"lat":52.52437,"lon":13.41053}},{"facility":"Hannover Medical School","city":"Hanover","zip":"30625","country":"Germany","geoPoint":{"lat":52.37052,"lon":9.73322}},{"facility":"Asklepios Fachklinikum Lübben","city":"Lubin","country":"Germany","geoPoint":{"lat":51.93814,"lon":13.88826}},{"facility":"Asklepios Fachklinikum Teupitz","city":"Teupitz","country":"Germany","geoPoint":{"lat":52.12967,"lon":13.6196}}]}}}}